@startuml analysis

title Analysis Layer — planned Phase 5

note as Dep
  Dependency: Boost.Process (BSL-1.0)
  Cross-platform child process management.
  Stockfish runs as an external subprocess
  communicating via UCI over stdin/stdout.
end note

class UCIEngine <<planned Phase 5>> {
    - process : boost::process::child
    - stdin_pipe : boost::process::opstream
    - stdout_pipe : boost::process::ipstream
    + connect(string stockfishPath) : bool
    + setPosition(string fen, vector<string> moves)
    + analyze(int depth) : EngineResult
    + shutdown()
    - sendCommand(string cmd)
    - readLine() : string
    - parseInfoLine(string) : void
}

class EngineResult <<planned Phase 5>> {
    + bestMove : string
    + ponderMove : string
    + score : float
    + depth : int
    + pvLine : vector<string>
}

class Statistics <<planned Phase 5>> {
    - db : Database&
    - engine : UCIEngine&
    + analyzeGame(int gameId)
    + detectBlunders(int gameId, float threshold) : vector<BlunderInfo>
    + getOpeningStats(string eco) : OpeningStats
    + getPositionFrequency(string fen) : int
    + getPerformanceTrend(string player, string dateFrom, string dateTo) : vector<TrendPoint>
}

class BlunderInfo <<planned Phase 5>> {
    + moveNumber : int
    + move : string
    + evalBefore : float
    + evalAfter : float
    + drop : float
    + severity : string
}

class OpeningStats <<planned Phase 5>> {
    + eco : string
    + name : string
    + gamesPlayed : int
    + wins : int
    + draws : int
    + losses : int
    + winRate : float
}

class TrendPoint <<planned Phase 5>> {
    + date : string
    + accuracy : float
    + blunderRate : float
}

UCIEngine ..> EngineResult : produces
Statistics ..> UCIEngine : calls for eval
Statistics ..> BlunderInfo : produces
Statistics ..> OpeningStats : produces
Statistics ..> TrendPoint : produces

note right of UCIEngine
  UCI protocol flow:
  1. spawn stockfish process
  2. send "uci" → wait "uciok"
  3. send "isready" → wait "readyok"
  4. send "position fen <fen>"
  5. send "go depth <N>"
  6. parse "info depth ... score cp ..." lines
  7. wait for "bestmove <move>"
  8. send "quit" on shutdown

  Blunder threshold:
  > 0.5 pawns drop = mistake
  > 2.0 pawns drop = blunder
end note

@enduml
